ew.\n\nWhich is best? Possibly Candidate C: strong anticipation, complex connections, leadership, spatial vision important for long-distance. Concerns: unorganized, not good at criticism. Could be mitigated? Candidate A's communication difficulty may be more severe. Candidate B's uncooperative may be severe. Candidate D's arrogance also severe.\n\nThus I might recommend Candidate C as provisional.\n\nWe need to reference discussion (none) but can say \"To start, I think Candidate C stands out because...\" Provide evidence.\n\nLet's produce public message with vote C."}
